# Lab 3 - Part 1.1 bring-up record

## Before the lab

- [ ] Instructor repository forked; origin verified as my fork.
- [ ] Fork opened in VS Code through Ubuntu WSL.
- [ ] README, Getting Started, and Parts 1.1-1.4 read.
- [ ] PulseView installed in Windows; analyzer-specific Blackboard notes checked.
- [ ] NASM available; supplied Programs 1 and 2 built for group preparation.
- [ ] Logger enable-condition checked; correction prepared if needed.
- [ ] Pi86 microSD, Pi 3B/+, V20 daughterboard, analyzer, probes, grounds, monitor, keyboard, and power supply available.

