- [ ] Physical orientation and pin-1 reference confirmed against the actual board.
- [ ] Ground leads connected to verified GND points; no supply pin used as GND.
- [ ] Probes attached only with Pi power and analyzer USB disconnected.
- [ ] Pi86 was stopped before arming the boot capture.
- [ ] Analyzer armed before launching PI86_LOG=0 ./run_pi86.sh.
- [ ] Actual terminal output confirmed bus logging disabled.
- [ ] DOS A:\> prompt reached.

